# DUN DUN DUN sandwich

## Assumptions
- The bread, the jar of peanut butter, the can of grape jelly and the knife are all present.

## Steps
- open the jar of peanut butter
- remove the foil
- grab your knife
- untwist the tie open
- drop the knife
- grab the bread out of the bag
- slice your bread slices

## done when
- sandwich is together
